{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body><div class=\"_more_content_\">\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_2\">\n<p>見到網民講到咁神，小編即刻去 Donki 買咗支返嚟親身實測！用法真係超簡單，跟住以下 3 步就搞掂：</p>\n<img alt=\"threads 爆紅『獅王去漬神器』！15秒擊退污漬不留 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/2-2_19211934176a0d39af8623b-1024x1280.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_3\">\n<p>1️⃣ 墊：先將吸污紙墊喺污漬下面 (就算無吸污紙，用紙巾墊底都一樣得！)</p>\n<p>2️⃣ 篤：用去漬神器篤落污漬位</p>\n<p>3️⃣ 吸：啲污漬真係會轉移落張吸污紙度！</p>\n<img alt=\"threads 爆紅『獅王去漬神器』！15秒擊退污漬不留 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/3-1_8499637986a0d39a2864e3-1024x1280.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_4\">\n<p>小編實測唔使 15 秒就將白衫上嘅污漬神還原，最驚喜係乾咗之後完全無留低尷尬嘅「水漬印」！！</p>\n<h2>點解佢比一般去漬產品好用？</h2>\n<p>1/ 唔會愈抹愈大撻： 採用扁平塗抹出口，做到「鏢靶式去漬」，有效避免好似噴霧或濕紙巾咁令污漬擴散 。</p>\n<img alt=\"threads 爆紅『獅王去漬神器』！15秒擊退污漬不留 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/4-1_5190793396a0d39bba5e7f-1024x1280.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_5\">\n<p>2/ 細細支輕巧便攜：體積細過 AirPods 或唇膏，放喺小廢包返工、約會隨身帶都超方便 。</p>\n<img alt=\"threads 爆紅『獅王去漬神器』！15秒擊退污漬不留 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/5-1_136426246a0d39a0222cc-1024x1280.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_6\">\n<p>3/ 隱藏好物： 難怪被網民列為 Donki 必買嘅隱藏好物 ！</p>\n<img alt=\"threads 爆紅『獅王去漬神器』！15秒擊退污漬不留 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" data-src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cs-0804_wwig_-7_8004427946a0d39c0f0064-1024x1280.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/themes/bucket/theme-content/images/default.jpg\" width=\"960\">（圖片來源：官方圖片）\n</div>\n<div class=\"_page_ _page_7\">\n<h2>包包必備的「白衫救星」</h2>\n<p>呢支「獅王去漬神器」喺全線 Donki 有售，下次經過 Donki 記得入手，建議囤多幾支喺公司同手袋備用啦！\n</p></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-20T09:41:45.623942+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":450,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}